  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_01a",
      "hash64": "C09C981A1D630235",
      "text": "The weather’s in your favor today. I guess the\\nsnowy mountains decided to be kind.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_01b",
      "hash64": "C09C951A1D62FD1C",
      "text": "Well, tough luck for you. The snowy mountains\\nare on my side today.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_02",
      "hash64": "9157825018C8E663",
      "text": "These League-mandated inspections happen\\na few times a year.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_03",
      "hash64": "9157815018C8E4B0",
      "text": "If we don’t show we’re up for the job, we’ll lose\\nour positions as Gym Leaders.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_04",
      "hash64": "9157885018C8F095",
      "text": "Geeta always says it’s just a formality, but...[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_05",
      "hash64": "9157875018C8EEE2",
      "text": "I’ve already had to give up on being a pro\\nsnowboarder. If she takes away the talents\\r\\nI still have to show, then what’ll be left?[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_06",
      "hash64": "9157865018C8ED2F",
      "text": "Sorry, didn’t mean to bring the temperature\\ndown. It’s simple enough, really.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_07",
      "hash64": "9157855018C8EB7C",
      "text": "All I need to do is make sure the power of my\\nPokémon chills you to the bone![VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_08",
      "hash64": "91578C5018C8F761",
      "text": "Man, Geeta must really have it out for me.\\nSending someone there’s no way I could beat...[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_09",
      "hash64": "91578B5018C8F5AE",
      "text": "Still, no regrets on my part. I gave it everything\\nI had.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_10",
      "hash64": "9153FE5018C5D040",
      "text": "I hit you full force, and I lost anyway. It made me\\nfeel...frustrated.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_11",
      "hash64": "9153FF5018C5D1F3",
      "text": "It makes me want to become stronger as a Gym\\nLeader. Put more of myself into it.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_12",
      "hash64": "9154005018C5D3A6",
      "text": "I’d thought my passion had frozen over, but...\\nyou’ve rekindled it for me.\\c\\nThanks, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_13",
      "hash64": "9154015018C5D559",
      "text": "I won’t lose next time. You’ll see.[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_koori_020_koori_14",
      "hash64": "9154025018C5D70C",
      "text": "Try not to catch a cold on your way down\\nthe mountain, eh?[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
